            "target_entity_type": "Experiment",
            "paragraph": "Based on the BCC-CSM2-MR model for the current and future climate scenarios, two contrasting future pathways SSP126 and SSP370, were selected to project the bioclimatic and precipitation data in the 2050s (2041\u20132060) and 2070s (2061\u20132080).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
